<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#fffdf6"><title>Reset your password | Sherubtse Lost &amp; Found</title><link rel="icon" href="/Sherubtse_logo/images.jpg"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><script src="/js/app.js" defer></script></head><body><%- include('partials/navbar') %><main class="auth-layout"><section class="auth-aside"><span class="eyebrow">Sherubtse student accounts</span><h1>A fresh start for your account.</h1><p>Use the one-time code sent to your registered college email. Never share it with anyone.</p><div class="aside-crest"><img src="/Sherubtse_logo/images.jpg" alt="Sherubtse College crest"></div></section><section class="auth-panel"><h2>Reset your password</h2><p class="muted">Codes expire after 30 minutes. Only the latest code works, once. After five incorrect attempts, request another code.</p><p class="form-notice">Request a code first, then enter it below. For privacy, requests do not confirm whether an account exists or an email was delivered. If no code arrives, sending may have failed; try again later.</p><form class="stack-form" data-code-form="reset"><label>College email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" pattern="[0-9]{8}\.sherubtse@rub\.edu\.bt" maxlength="254" placeholder="07240068.sherubtse@rub.edu.bt" required></label><button id="request-code" class="button button-gold" type="button">Request reset code</button><small class="muted">Wait 60 seconds between requests. Check your spam folder too.</small><label>Eight-digit code<input name="code" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" pattern="[0-9]{8}" minlength="8" maxlength="8" required></label><div class="password-fields"><label>New password<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="10" pattern="(?=.*[A-Z])(?=.*[0-9])(?=.*[^A-Za-z0-9\s]).{10,}" aria-describedby="reset-password-help" required><small id="reset-password-help">At least 10 characters, one uppercase letter, one digit and one special character. At most 72 UTF-8 bytes.</small></label><label>Confirm new password<input name="confirmPassword" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="10" required></label></div><button class="button button-navy" type="submit">Save new password</button><p id="form-message" class="form-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form><p id="auth-complete" class="form-notice" hidden><a href="/login">Continue to sign in</a></p><p class="auth-switch"><a href="/login">Back to sign in</a> &middot; <a href="/verify">Verify your email</a></p></section></main><%- include('partials/footer') %></body></html>
